				"<shadow><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7 f=0.3>用</grad><grad from=#8B4513 to=#CD853F f=0.8>风箱</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7 f=0.3>加速冶炼！</grad></shadow>"
